    "message": "Pin the walk's order-dependent branches against the Python rule\n\nThe gate and 7 days never reach a queue trip's replan or a person placed\nin a slot during the walk, so these tests are all that compares them.\nThey pass here with the kernel refusing, through the Python rule.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01K4QyYRukuCLBerKa4UYj4y",
